{"id": "17-3236-2-2", "zh": "cur 等词根类（Curādigaṇa）", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3237-2-11", "zh": "cura（偷盗义）。和前面一样，词根末音省略，然后生起语尾。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3238-2-27", "zh": "从“Tathā kattari ca”这条规则起，“kattari”（主动语态）以狮子回顾法延续下来，“bhāva”（无人称语态）和“kamma”（被动语态）的取用也延续下来；“kārita”（使役词缀）的取用则以蛙跳法延续下来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3239-2-7", "zh": "525. 在 cur 等词根之后，加 ṇe、ṇaya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3240-2-17", "zh": "在 cura 等这一词根类之后，当后面接语尾和词缀时，有 ṇe、ṇaya 这两个词缀，用于主动语态、无人称语态和被动语态。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3240-18-29", "zh": "依“Kāritaṃ viya ṇānubandho”这条规则，ṇe、ṇaya 被称为使役词缀（kārita）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3241-2-8", "zh": "526. 使役词缀的 ṇ 被省略。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3242-2-6", "zh": "使役词缀的 ṇ 音被省略。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3243-2-8", "zh": "527. 不以复辅音结尾的词根，在使役词缀之前增音（vuddhi）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3244-2-10", "zh": "不以复辅音结尾的词根，后面接使役词缀时要增音，所以 u 音增音为 o 音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3245-2-6", "zh": "dhanaṃ coreti（他偷财物），corenti（他们偷）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3245-7-10", "zh": "coresi（你偷），coretha（你们偷）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3245-11-14", "zh": "coremi（我偷），corema（我们偷）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3245-15-21", "zh": "用 ṇaya 词缀时：corayati，corayanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3245-22-25", "zh": "corayasi，corayatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3245-26-29", "zh": "corayāmi，corayāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3245-30-33", "zh": "corayate，corayante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3245-34-37", "zh": "corayase，corayavhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3245-38-41", "zh": "coraye，corayāmhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3246-2-18", "zh": "在被动语态中，加 ya 词缀时增加 ī 音，并有元音省略等变化：corīyate devadattena（被天授偷），corīyati，corīyanti，等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3247-2-6", "zh": "coretu（让他偷），corentu（让他们偷）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3247-7-8", "zh": "corehi（你偷吧）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3247-9-12", "zh": "corayatu，corayantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3247-13-16", "zh": "coraya，corayāhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3248-2-5", "zh": "coreyya（他应该偷），coreyyuṃ（他们应该偷）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3248-6-9", "zh": "coraye，corayeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3248-10-17", "zh": "acoresi（他偷了），coresi，acoresuṃ（他们偷了），coresuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3248-18-29", "zh": "acorayi，corayi，acorayiṃsu，corayiṃsu，acorayuṃ，corayuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3248-30-33", "zh": "acoresi，acoresittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3248-34-38", "zh": "tvaṃ acorayi（你偷了），acorayittha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3248-39-42", "zh": "acoresiṃ，acoresimha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3248-43-46", "zh": "acorayiṃ，acorayimha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3248-47-48", "zh": "acorayittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3248-49-52", "zh": "acorīyittha，acorīyi（被偷了）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3249-2-5", "zh": "corissati（他将偷），corissanti（他们将偷）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3249-6-9", "zh": "corayissati，corayissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3249-10-13", "zh": "corīyissate，corīyissante（将被偷）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3249-14-17", "zh": "corīyissati，corīyissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3249-18-21", "zh": "acorissa（他本来会偷），acorayissa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3249-22-26", "zh": "acorīyissatha，acorīyissa，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3250-2-9", "zh": "同样，cinta（思考义）；因为它以复辅音结尾，所以不增音，这是唯一的区别。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3251-2-9", "zh": "cinteti，cintayati，cintenti，cintayanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3251-10-13", "zh": "cintetu，cintayatu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3251-14-17", "zh": "cinteyya，cintayeyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3251-18-25", "zh": "acintesi，cintesi，acintayi，cintayi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3251-26-29", "zh": "cintessati，cintayissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3251-30-34", "zh": "acintissa，acintayissa，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3252-2-11", "zh": "manta（秘密商议义）：manteti，mantayati，等等，和前面相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3253-2-9", "zh": "pāla（守护义）：dhammaṃ pāleti（他守护法），pālayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3253-10-11", "zh": "pālīyati（被守护）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3253-12-16", "zh": "pāletu，pālayatu，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3254-2-16", "zh": "ghaṭa（结合义）：ghāṭeti，ghāṭayati，ghaṭeti，ghaṭayati；因为它属于 ghaṭa 等词根，增音是可选的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3255-2-8", "zh": "vida（了知义）：vedeti，vedayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3256-2-23", "zh": "gaṇa（计数义）：依“ghaṭādīnaṃ vā”这条规则，不增音：gaṇeti，gaṇayati，等等；其余各处都容易理解。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3257-2-3", "zh": "cur 等词根类结束。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3258-2-10", "zh": "bhū 等类、rudh 等类，div 等类、su 等类；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3259-2-10", "zh": "kī 等类、tan 等类，以及 cur 等类，这里共分七类。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3260-2-4", "zh": "词根插入词缀（vikaraṇa）的规则讲完了。", "confidence": 75}
